5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I want to make sure the new system actually works for the folks on the floor. Let's pick things that show how it handles the real world!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree we need a practical view, but we must also be cautious about the long-term financial commitments. Hidden costs can be a nightmare.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I am concerned about governance and scope creep. We need to see how previous transitions were managed and who actually took responsibility when things failed.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know if the old stuff just got dusty or if we paid people to fix things they broke! Let's find the secrets!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. Let us look beyond the software and see the people. A tool is only as strong as the hands that hold it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, that's true! But if the yard devices are ancient, the best hands in the world can't make it work. I'm looking at the hardware side.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, hardware is a one-time hit. I'm more worried about the recurring invoices and the board's approval patterns.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, costs are irrelevant if the system doesn't match the business needs. I want to see the actual rollout history and the support ownership.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, that sounds boring! I want to see the ""oopsies""! Like when the power went out or when the data got all mixed up!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,It is the quiet transitions that often hide the loudest struggles. I shall look into the people who keep our wheels turning.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm set! I'll check the yard devices and the depot calendar. We can't have a crash during peak season!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll focus on the money. I'm choosing the renewal invoices and the board minutes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will investigate the support ownership during last winter's outage and the depot supervisors and the last rollout.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm going for the data lift in the 2018 pay move and the upgrade history of the dispatch tool! I bet there's a story there!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I will look into the administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as the depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
