34,2,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, the yard is a mess! We really can't afford another paper-dispatch disaster during peak season. We need something super rugged and flexible.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we have a habit of ignoring the ""small"" recurring costs. The board approves the big check, but the monthly bleed is where we lose.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,As I suspected. We have a systemic failure in ownership and a tendency for the business to drift away from the agreed plan almost immediately.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"I found it! The dispatch tool is like a dinosaur that forgot to evolve, and the 2018 pay move was a total mess that we had to clean up!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The wind is blowing cold on our staffing. We are leaning on a few tired shoulders, and the new blood is not arriving to help.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, if the ownership is a mess, we need a vendor who will hold our hand through the whole thing, especially in the yards!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, ""hand-holding"" usually comes with a very expensive monthly service fee. We need a vendor with a transparent, flat-fee structure.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, a flat fee is useless if the vendor claims the failure is ""out of scope"" because the business changed. We need strict governance.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Why do we keep paying people to do things wrong? If the 2018 move was a mess, we shouldn't trust the same kind of ""experts"" again!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"We must be gentle. If we force a rigid system on a stretched crew, they will simply break. We need a path of least resistance.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I just want to make sure the drivers don't hate us! If the system is too fancy for the yard, it's a fail.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm looking for a vendor that doesn't hide costs in ""add-ons"" or ""maintenance tiers."" The renewal invoices showed me exactly how we get tricked.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"I am looking for a vendor that provides a single point of accountability. I will not accept another ""finger-pointing"" exercise during an outage.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I want a system that stays new! No more ""skipping upgrades"" because it's too scary. It should be like a video game update—just click and go!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,Let us remember that the most sophisticated map is useless if the traveler is too exhausted to walk. Simplicity is the greatest kindness.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
